<title>POLAND: Stalexport trades on kerb at PLN 36.5.</title>
<headline>Stalexport trades on kerb at PLN 36.5.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 200,000 shares in steel trader Stalexport SA at 36.5 zlotys per share was struck on the Warsaw Stock Exchange on Thursday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular bourse session Stalexport fell 2.2 percent to 36.2 zlotys in a volume of 28,944 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
